  "worked_solution": "The existential quantifier \"$\u2203$\" means \"there exists.\" So, our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **There exists** $q\\in Q$ **such that** $3q=2.$ \n\nThis can be further simplified as follows:\n\n$\\,$ There exists a rational number whose triple is $2.$\n\n**Note:** This statement is true.",
